ri can't understand her due to her Jewel Land Language until Ruby took a special candy so she could speak and understand human language. As the day passes, Ruby knew about her problems and later apologized. A Jewel Charm appeared on Akari's hand and she realized it that she's chosen by Ruby to be her partner. After that, she decided to enter the Jewel Star Grand Prix, on the prize is that any wish that they wanted will be granted. Will she be the Next Jewel Star and her wish be granted in the end? Or I'll just end in one big disaster...\n\n(Source: Wikipedia)"},"tags":[{"name":"Magic","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Animals","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Henshin","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cute Girls Doing Cute Things","rank":46,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kids","rank":46,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Witch","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Jewelpet Twinkle☆","english":null,"native":"ジュエルペット てぃんくる☆","romaji":"Jewelpet Twinkle☆","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"宝石宠物 Tinkle☆"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"宝石宠物 Twinkle☆"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}